[{:db/id "ed23ef92-0aad-5b95-947e-ba7002f159c6" :answer/id #uuid "ed23ef92-0aad-5b95-947e-ba7002f159c6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "u \\sqrt{v^{2} + 1}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "011655a2-c520-5cd0-a439-defc348c17b1" :answer/id #uuid "011655a2-c520-5cd0-a439-defc348c17b1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "a0bde4ca-48f5-5c86-ad8e-88083b8a8731" :answer/id #uuid "a0bde4ca-48f5-5c86-ad8e-88083b8a8731" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{14}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "91e08695-6405-567c-8d4e-0b8f3347a5f0" :answer/id #uuid "91e08695-6405-567c-8d4e-0b8f3347a5f0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2 \\sqrt{u + v}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "48815a36-e11f-5e50-85f2-1df30f980d9f" :answer/id #uuid "48815a36-e11f-5e50-85f2-1df30f980d9f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "32a31c4b-f831-5da9-8f29-1b931744a7c9" :answer-field/id #uuid "32a31c4b-f831-5da9-8f29-1b931744a7c9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["ed23ef92-0aad-5b95-947e-ba7002f159c6" "011655a2-c520-5cd0-a439-defc348c17b1" "a0bde4ca-48f5-5c86-ad8e-88083b8a8731" "91e08695-6405-567c-8d4e-0b8f3347a5f0" "48815a36-e11f-5e50-85f2-1df30f980d9f"] :answer-field/correct "a0bde4ca-48f5-5c86-ad8e-88083b8a8731" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "6ce03692-58d4-5830-8d97-d77704c638fb" :question/id #uuid "6ce03692-58d4-5830-8d97-d77704c638fb" :question/problem "$$\n\\iint_D\\boxed{}\\,\\mathrm{d}A,\\quad D=\\{(u,v):0\\le u\\le 1,\\,0\\le v\\le 2\\}\n$$\n\nThe integral above gives the surface area of the parametric surface $r(u,v)=\\langle u + v,\\,3 - v,\\,3 u + 5 v + 1\\rangle$ for $0\\le u\\le 1,\\,0\\le v\\le 2.$ What is the missing expression?" :question/worked-solution "For a surface $S$ with parametrization $r(u,v)$ for $(u,v)\\in D,$ the surface area of $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\iint_S\\mathrm{d}S=\\iint_D\\left\\|\\mathbf r_u\\times\\mathbf r_v\\right\\|\\,\\mathrm{d}A.\n$$\n\nWe first compute the tangent vectors to the grid curves:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf r_u &=\\langle \\frac{\\partial x}{\\partial u},\\,\\frac{\\partial y}{\\partial u},\\,\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial u}\\rangle \\\\  &=\\langle \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u}\\left(u + v\\right),\\,\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u}\\left(3 - v\\right),\\,\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u}\\left(3 u + 5 v + 1\\right)\\rangle \\\\  &=\\langle 1,\\,0,\\,3\\rangle \\\\ \\mathbf r_v &=\\langle \\frac{\\partial x}{\\partial v},\\,\\frac{\\partial y}{\\partial v},\\,\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial v}\\rangle \\\\  &=\\langle \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial v}\\left(u + v\\right),\\,\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial v}\\left(3 - v\\right),\\,\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial v}\\left(3 u + 5 v + 1\\right)\\rangle \\\\  &=\\langle 1,\\,-1,\\,5\\rangle\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the fundamental vector product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf r_u\\times\\mathbf r_v &=\\begin{vmatrix}i & j & k \\\\ 1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 5\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  &=\\langle \\begin{vmatrix}0 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 5\\end{vmatrix},\\,-\\begin{vmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 5\\end{vmatrix},\\,\\begin{vmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{vmatrix}\\rangle \\\\  &=\\langle 3,\\,-2,\\,-1\\rangle\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\left\\|\\mathbf r_u\\times\\mathbf r_v\\right\\| &=\\left\\|\\langle 3,\\,-2,\\,-1\\rangle\\right\\| \\\\  &=\\sqrt{\\left(3\\right)^2+\\left(-2\\right)^2+\\left(-1\\right)^2} \\\\  &=\\sqrt{9+4+1} \\\\  &=\\sqrt{14} \\\\  &=\\sqrt{14}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface area is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\iint_S\\mathrm{d}S &=\\iint_D\\left\\|\\mathbf r_u\\times\\mathbf r_v\\right\\|\\,\\mathrm{d}A \\\\  &=\\iint_D \\sqrt{14}\\,\\mathrm{d}A\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["32a31c4b-f831-5da9-8f29-1b931744a7c9"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "cd1295a6-0f95-51f3-8fd1-ee96277ead12" :answer/id #uuid "cd1295a6-0f95-51f3-8fd1-ee96277ead12" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{13}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "6ce6fda6-b951-5d87-8a85-6283f433ac85" :answer/id #uuid "6ce6fda6-b951-5d87-8a85-6283f433ac85" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2 \\sqrt{u + v}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "0f83c76d-ec99-5241-aebf-9c4270e1a7ef" :answer/id #uuid "0f83c76d-ec99-5241-aebf-9c4270e1a7ef" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "u \\sqrt{v^{2} + 1}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "00cee569-5cea-5d57-9bc3-3903a71989af" :answer/id #uuid "00cee569-5cea-5d57-9bc3-3903a71989af" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "d2a1a18a-411a-5224-a056-02a4076cbe0e" :answer/id #uuid "d2a1a18a-411a-5224-a056-02a4076cbe0e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{30}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "6ffdcbfe-e3c8-554c-90ac-7c7fa5fdd703" :answer-field/id #uuid "6ffdcbfe-e3c8-554c-90ac-7c7fa5fdd703" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["cd1295a6-0f95-51f3-8fd1-ee96277ead12" "6ce6fda6-b951-5d87-8a85-6283f433ac85" "0f83c76d-ec99-5241-aebf-9c4270e1a7ef" "00cee569-5cea-5d57-9bc3-3903a71989af" "d2a1a18a-411a-5224-a056-02a4076cbe0e"] :answer-field/correct "d2a1a18a-411a-5224-a056-02a4076cbe0e" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "f12a3689-dba6-56d9-843d-c0f7bf0ac72a" :question/id #uuid "f12a3689-dba6-56d9-843d-c0f7bf0ac72a" :question/problem "$$\n\\iint_D\\boxed{}\\,\\mathrm{d}A,\\quad D=\\{(u,v):0\\le u\\le 1,\\,0\\le v\\le 2\\}\n$$\n\nThe integral above gives the surface area of the parametric surface $r(u,v)=\\langle u + v,\\,3 - v,\\,5 u + 7 v + 1\\rangle$ for $0\\le u\\le 1,\\,0\\le v\\le 2.$ What is the missing expression?" :question/worked-solution "For a surface $S$ with parametrization $r(u,v)$ for $(u,v)\\in D,$ the surface area of $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\iint_S\\mathrm{d}S=\\iint_D\\left\\|\\mathbf r_u\\times\\mathbf r_v\\right\\|\\,\\mathrm{d}A.\n$$\n\nWe first compute the tangent vectors to the grid curves:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf r_u &=\\langle \\frac{\\partial x}{\\partial u},\\,\\frac{\\partial y}{\\partial u},\\,\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial u}\\rangle \\\\  &=\\langle \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u}\\left(u + v\\right),\\,\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u}\\left(3 - v\\right),\\,\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u}\\left(5 u + 7 v + 1\\right)\\rangle \\\\  &=\\langle 1,\\,0,\\,5\\rangle \\\\ \\mathbf r_v &=\\langle \\frac{\\partial x}{\\partial v},\\,\\frac{\\partial y}{\\partial v},\\,\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial v}\\rangle \\\\  &=\\langle \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial v}\\left(u + v\\right),\\,\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial v}\\left(3 - v\\right),\\,\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial v}\\left(5 u + 7 v + 1\\right)\\rangle \\\\  &=\\langle 1,\\,-1,\\,7\\rangle\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the fundamental vector product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf r_u\\times\\mathbf r_v &=\\begin{vmatrix}i & j & k \\\\ 1 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 7\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  &=\\langle \\begin{vmatrix}0 & 5 \\\\ -1 & 7\\end{vmatrix},\\,-\\begin{vmatrix}1 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 7\\end{vmatrix},\\,\\begin{vmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{vmatrix}\\rangle \\\\  &=\\langle 5,\\,-2,\\,-1\\rangle\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\left\\|\\mathbf r_u\\times\\mathbf r_v\\right\\| &=\\left\\|\\langle 5,\\,-2,\\,-1\\rangle\\right\\| \\\\  &=\\sqrt{\\left(5\\right)^2+\\left(-2\\right)^2+\\left(-1\\right)^2} \\\\  &=\\sqrt{25+4+1} \\\\  &=\\sqrt{30} \\\\  &=\\sqrt{30}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface area is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\iint_S\\mathrm{d}S &=\\iint_D\\left\\|\\mathbf r_u\\times\\mathbf r_v\\right\\|\\,\\mathrm{d}A \\\\  &=\\iint_D \\sqrt{30}\\,\\mathrm{d}A\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["6ffdcbfe-e3c8-554c-90ac-7c7fa5fdd703"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "a2f43bf4-274b-5f91-890a-212b06e6e8c7" :answer/id #uuid "a2f43bf4-274b-5f91-890a-212b06e6e8c7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "v^{2} \\sqrt{16 u^{2} + 1}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "3bbc89bf-4b41-500d-a74f-a5a23cc77a9a" :answer/id #uuid "3bbc89bf-4b41-500d-a74f-a5a23cc77a9a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{4 u^{2} + v^{2}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "43feaff8-ab49-5cc0-a22e-c79061a43457" :answer/id #uuid "43feaff8-ab49-5cc0-a22e-c79061a43457" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2 v \\sqrt{32 u^{2} + 1}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "733b93c8-4090-5697-9f6e-1b3b25a0447f" :answer/id #uuid "733b93c8-4090-5697-9f6e-1b3b25a0447f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{- 4 u^{2} + v^{2}}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "0b115ea7-8c75-582e-bcb9-c63407864ed8" :answer/id #uuid "0b115ea7-8c75-582e-bcb9-c63407864ed8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "u \\sqrt{16 v + 1}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "8cf6d408-766c-507b-a6fd-42b33e06fe2a" :answer-field/id #uuid "8cf6d408-766c-507b-a6fd-42b33e06fe2a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["a2f43bf4-274b-5f91-890a-212b06e6e8c7" "3bbc89bf-4b41-500d-a74f-a5a23cc77a9a" "43feaff8-ab49-5cc0-a22e-c79061a43457" "733b93c8-4090-5697-9f6e-1b3b25a0447f" "0b115ea7-8c75-582e-bcb9-c63407864ed8"] :answer-field/correct "43feaff8-ab49-5cc0-a22e-c79061a43457" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "c17b6edc-1f0e-51cb-a0ce-11f93aba061f" :question/id #uuid "c17b6edc-1f0e-51cb-a0ce-11f93aba061f" :question/problem "$$\n\\iint_D\\boxed{}\\,\\mathrm{d}A,\\quad D=\\{(u,v):0\\le u\\le 2,\\,0\\le v\\le 2\\}\n$$\n\nThe integral above gives the surface area of the parametric surface $r(u,v)=\\langle 2 u^{2},\\,u - v^{2},\\,v^{2}\\rangle$ for $0\\le u\\le 2,\\,0\\le v\\le 2.$ What is the missing expression?" :question/worked-solution "For a surface $S$ with parametrization $r(u,v)$ for $(u,v)\\in D,$ the surface area of $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\iint_S\\mathrm{d}S=\\iint_D\\left\\|\\mathbf r_u\\times\\mathbf r_v\\right\\|\\,\\mathrm{d}A.\n$$\n\nWe first compute the tangent vectors to the grid curves:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf r_u &=\\langle \\frac{\\partial x}{\\partial u},\\,\\frac{\\partial y}{\\partial u},\\,\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial u}\\rangle \\\\  &=\\langle \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u}\\left(2 u^{2}\\right),\\,\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u}\\left(u - v^{2}\\right),\\,\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial u}\\left(v^{2}\\right)\\rangle \\\\  &=\\langle 4 u,\\,1,\\,0\\rangle \\\\ \\mathbf r_v &=\\langle \\frac{\\partial x}{\\partial v},\\,\\frac{\\partial y}{\\partial v},\\,\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial v}\\rangle \\\\  &=\\langle \\frac{\\partial}{\\partial v}\\left(2 u^{2}\\right),\\,\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial v}\\left(u - v^{2}\\right),\\,\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial v}\\left(v^{2}\\right)\\rangle \\\\  &=\\langle 0,\\,- 2 v,\\,2 v\\rangle\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the fundamental vector product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf r_u\\times\\mathbf r_v &=\\begin{vmatrix}i & j & k \\\\ 4 u & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & - 2 v & 2 v\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  &=\\langle \\begin{vmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ - 2 v & 2 v\\end{vmatrix},\\,-\\begin{vmatrix}4 u & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 v\\end{vmatrix},\\,\\begin{vmatrix}4 u & 1 \\\\ 0 & - 2 v\\end{vmatrix}\\rangle \\\\  &=\\langle 2 v,\\,- 8 u v,\\,- 8 u v\\rangle\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\left\\|\\mathbf r_u\\times\\mathbf r_v\\right\\| &=\\left\\|\\langle 2 v,\\,- 8 u v,\\,- 8 u v\\rangle\\right\\| \\\\  &=\\sqrt{\\left(2 v\\right)^2+\\left(- 8 u v\\right)^2+\\left(- 8 u v\\right)^2} \\\\  &=\\sqrt{4 v^{2}+64 u^{2} v^{2}+64 u^{2} v^{2}} \\\\  &=\\sqrt{128 u^{2} v^{2} + 4 v^{2}} \\\\  &=\\sqrt{4 v^{2} \\left(32 u^{2} + 1\\right)} \\\\  &=\\sqrt{4 v^{2}}\\sqrt{32 u^{2} + 1} \\\\  &=2 v \\sqrt{32 u^{2} + 1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that $\\sqrt{v^2}=v$ since $v\\ge 0$ on $D.$\n\nTherefore, the surface area is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\iint_S\\mathrm{d}S &=\\iint_D\\left\\|\\mathbf r_u\\times\\mathbf r_v\\right\\|\\,\\mathrm{d}A \\\\  &=\\iint_D 2 v \\sqrt{32 u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}A\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["8cf6d408-766c-507b-a6fd-42b33e06fe2a"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "07e761a3-b1f5-5c61-8c49-dfcd9841b9e9" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186119889.py"} [:db/add 17592186119889 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] {:db/id 17592186119889 :knowledge-point/questions ["6ce03692-58d4-5830-8d97-d77704c638fb" "f12a3689-dba6-56d9-843d-c0f7bf0ac72a" "c17b6edc-1f0e-51cb-a0ce-11f93aba061f"]} [:db/ensure 17592186119889 :knowledge-point/validate]]
